<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PREBOX - Mystery Box Pakistan</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#0f0f0f;color:white;text-align:center}
header{padding:50px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff2d55,#ff9500)}
header h1{font-size:48px;margin:0}
header p{font-size:18px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:white;color:black;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:30px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-top:15px}
.box{background:#1c1c1c;margin:20px;padding:20px;border-radius:15px}
.price{color:#ffcc00;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold}
footer{padding:20px;color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>PREBOX</h1>
<p>Pakistan's Most Exciting Mystery Box</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/923000000000">Order on WhatsApp</a>
</header>

<div class="box">
<h2>🎁 Mini Box</h2>
<p>Surprise items worth more than price</p>
<div class="price">Rs. 999</div>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>🔥 Premium Box</h2>
<p>Premium gadgets + accessories + surprise gift</p>
<div class="price">Rs. 1,999</div>
</div>

<div class="box">
<h2>👑 Mega Box</h2>
<p>Biggest value - Limited Stock</p>
<div class="price">Rs. 3,999</div>
</div>

<footer>© 2026 PREBOX - Cash on Delivery Available All Over Pakistan</footer>
</body>
</html>
